# AI SDK 7

- Use the pinned AI SDK 7 APIs in this repo (`ai@7.x`). Consult version-specific docs (Context7 / official) before relying on remembered APIs.
- One agent runtime only — do not introduce LangChain, LangGraph, Mastra, CrewAI, or a second framework.
- Use typed runtime context and typed tools; tool sets are explicitly allowlisted by mode.
- Set hard step, duration, tool-call, context, and cost limits (`budgets.ts`).
- Provider differences stay behind capability interfaces.
- Model output is untrusted until validated. Citations and learner updates are proposals, not authoritative writes.
- Do not log request/response bodies by default.
